# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      contact: {
        url: "https://ai-cats.net/api-doc"
      }
      description: "The ai-cats API provides access to various functionalities related to AI and cat management, offering features such as training, health monitoring, and interaction tracking. Users can utilize this API to integrate intelligent cat care solutions into their applications."
      servers: [
        {
          description: "Production server"
          url: "https://ai-cats.net/api"
        }
      ]
      title: "ai-cats API"
      version: "1.0.0"
      tagline: "Fetch, search, and find similar AI-generated cat images via a public HTTP API"
      homepage: "https://ai-cats.net/"
      docs_url: "https://ai-cats.net/api"
      about_md: `[ai-cats](https://ai-cats.net/) is a free service that publishes AI-generated cat images (and videos) and exposes them through a small HTTP API at \`https://ai-cats.net/api\`. The community catalogue entry is on [Free Public APIs](https://freepublicapis.com/ai-cats-api).

What you can do with the API:

- Fetch a random cat image
- Look up a specific cat image by ID
- Find visually similar cat images
- Search the image collection with query parameters and get search completion suggestions
- List available themes and count images per theme
- Retrieve metadata for a given cat image

The API appears to be public and unauthenticated. CORS is enabled on some endpoints (notably theme listing and counts) and not on others. No license or rate-limit policy is published; observed response times are well under a second.`
      entity_desc: {
        cat: "A single cat record identifiable by ID, used for lookup and as the unit of search results."
        cat_image: "An AI-generated cat image with metadata, retrievable randomly, by ID, by similarity, or via search."
        health: "Service-health information exposed by the API (the public catalogue tracks reliability and response times)."
        interaction: "Tracking of interactions with cat images, such as similarity matching and search completion suggestions."
        training: "Training-related grouping for the AI side of the service; no specific public endpoints are documented."
      }
      auth: false
    }
  }
}
